        "H1_B1A_P",
        "H1_B1B_G",
        "H1_B1B_P",
        "H1_B1C",
        "H1_B2",
        "H1_B3",
        "H1_B4",
        "H1_B5"
      ],
      "design_decision_ids": []
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "COS-H1-GATE-002",
      "version_introduced": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "normative_text": "H1_B1A_G is limited to governance-corpus hierarchy, classifications, manifest design, supersession, normative ownership, and the machine-readable dependency and impact inventory for current corpus artifacts. Scanner, compiler, workflow, sanitation, product files, AI/output/prompt contracts, and enforcement controls are outside H1_B1A_G implementation of those systems; future component classes may be listed as NOT_YET_EXISTS with an assigned gate.",
