    {
      "rule_id": "COS-H1-OWNER-011",
      "version_introduced": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "normative_text": "Publication uses a two-checkpoint model. Stage A may create only the child issue and one Issue #58 linkage comment under separate exact owner implementation authority. Stage B requires separate owner activation after child-issue readback, final PR-body reseal, and independent Red-Team review. Authorization is event-bounded and single-use; premise drift or unexpected objects expire authorization.",
